# Components and variants

- **Exports:** named exports from `ComponentName.tsx`; re-export from `src/components/react/index.ts` only (no new export paths without a project decision).
- **Styling:** use shared definitions in `src/common` (e.g. `tailwind-variants` patterns) consistently with existing components; avoid one-off duplicate token strings when a variant already exists.
- **New components:** use `npm run generate:component` so stories and barrel wiring stay aligned.
- **Stories:** colocate with project convention under `src/stories/` (see existing stories for patterns).
